#: src/reference/guide/IDE.md:7
msgid "sbt with IDEs"
msgstr "sbt と IDE"

#: src/reference/guide/IDE.md:10
msgid ""
"While it's possible to code Scala with just an editor and sbt, most "
"programmers today use an Integrated Development Environment, or IDE for "
"short. Two of the popular IDEs in Scala are [Metals](https://scalameta.org/"
"metals/) and [IntelliJ IDEA](https://www.jetbrains.com/idea/), and they both "
"integrate with sbt builds."
msgstr ""
"エディタと sbt だけで Scala のコードを書くことも可能だが、今日日のプログラマ"
"の多くは統合開発環境 (IDE) を用いる。Scala の IDE は [Metals](https://"
"scalameta.org/metals/) と [IntelliJ IDEA](https://www.jetbrains.com/idea/) の"
"二強で、それぞれ sbt ビルドとの統合をサポートする。"

#: src/reference/guide/IDE.md:14
msgid "A few of the advantages of using the IDEs are:"
msgstr "IDE を使う利点をいくつか挙げると:"

#: src/reference/guide/IDE.md:16
msgid "Jump to definition"
msgstr "定義へのジャンプ"

#: src/reference/guide/IDE.md:17
msgid "Code completion based on static types"
msgstr "静的型付けに基づくコード補完"

#: src/reference/guide/IDE.md:18
msgid "Listing compilation errors, and jumping to the error positions"
msgstr "コンパイルエラーの列挙と、エラー地点へのジャンプ"

#: src/reference/guide/IDE.md:19
msgid "Interactive debugging"
msgstr "インタラクティブなデバッグ"

